## Unreleased (working tree)
- feat(setup): consolidate flow under `vibe setup` (menu + wizard), remove `vibe setting`, and deprecate `vibe init` in favor of `vibe setup`.
- feat(setup): add AI tool preflight scan (OpenCode, Claude, Gemini, Codex, Kiro) and explicit setup-state hints inside Setup Center.
- feat(agents): support batch sub-agent creation via `vibe agents create-many` and Setup Center action for fast team bootstrap.
- feat(conversation): add `vibe convo list`/`--active-only` and `vibe convo monitor` for realtime observation with optional join-as-watcher.
- ux(conversation): remove hard dependency on resource initialization; convo commands now run with a non-blocking workspace recommendation.
- refactor(src): reorganize source into domain folders (`src/commands/*`, `src/core/*`, `src/system/*`) and update module naming/import paths.
- docs: refresh README/CONTRIBUTING structure references and roadmap notes for setup center + non-blocking convo behavior.

